### ID: TC-05

---

### Title: 
Similar games are updated after navigating to another game

---

### Environment:
GameDB PC | **bd7771b** | Google Chrome

---

### Repro Steps:
1. Navigate to Top Games > select any game (Game A).
2. Navigate to another Game (Game B) via You may like section.
3. Observe You may like section.

---

### Observed result: 
Similar games from Game A are not displayed, only similar games related to Game B are shown.

---

### Expected result:
User sees similar games from Game B, there are no similar games from Game A displayed.
